  mortgage_check_initial_fees_ask: 'What should I ask the bank about the costs at signing?',
  mortgage_check_recurring_fees: 'Monthly charges on top',
  mortgage_check_recurring_fees_why: 'A small charge every month for twenty years is not a small charge.',
  mortgage_check_recurring_fees_ask: 'What do I pay every month besides the loan payment itself?',
  mortgage_check_insurance: 'Insurance you have to buy',
  mortgage_check_insurance_why: 'Some of it is genuinely required and some is simply sold. It runs for the whole term either way.',
  mortgage_check_insurance_ask: 'Which insurance is really compulsory, and can I buy it somewhere else?',
  mortgage_check_valuation: 'Who values the property, and at whose cost',
  mortgage_check_valuation_why: 'You usually pay for it, and the number it produces decides how much the bank will lend.',
  mortgage_check_valuation_ask: 'What happens if the valuation comes in below the price I agreed?',
  mortgage_check_rate_type: 'Whether the rate can change',
  mortgage_check_rate_type_why: 'A fixed rate makes every figure on this page a promise. Anything else makes them today’s picture.',
  mortgage_check_rate_type_ask: 'Is the rate fixed for the whole term, and if not, for how long?',
  mortgage_check_rate_exposure: 'What a changing rate follows',
  mortgage_check_rate_exposure_why: 'A rate that moves moves with something. Knowing what, and how often, is the difference between a risk you chose and one you did not see.',
  mortgage_check_rate_exposure_ask: 'What should I ask about a rate that can be reset?',
  mortgage_check_currency_risk: 'The currency of the loan',
  mortgage_check_currency_risk_why: 'If you earn in one currency and owe in another, your payment moves with the exchange rate and your salary does not.',
  mortgage_check_currency_risk_ask: 'What happens to my payment if the exchange rate moves 20%?',
  mortgage_check_grace_period: 'A lighter start',
  mortgage_check_grace_period_why: 'Paying only interest at the start feels like a discount and is the opposite. The debt does not fall, so you pay interest on the full amount for longer.',
  mortgage_check_grace_period_ask: 'How much more does the loan cost in total if I take the lighter start?',
  mortgage_check_early_repayment: 'If you want to pay the loan off early',
  mortgage_check_early_repayment_why: 'This matters if you plan to pay in a large sum later or close the loan sooner than the contract says.',
  mortgage_check_early_repayment_ask: 'If I repay the loan early, what should I check first?',
  mortgage_check_refinancing: 'If you want to move the loan to another bank',
  mortgage_check_refinancing_why: 'Rates change over twenty years. What it takes to leave is worth knowing before you arrive.',
  mortgage_check_refinancing_ask: 'What does it take to move this loan to another bank later?',
  mortgage_check_penalties: 'If a payment is late',
  mortgage_check_penalties_why: 'Over twenty years a late payment is a real possibility, and what it triggers ranges from a small charge to the whole balance falling due.',
  mortgage_check_penalties_ask: 'What happens if a payment is a week late, and if it is a month late?',
  mortgage_sign_why_label: 'Why it matters',
  mortgage_sign_ask_label: 'Ask the bank',
  mortgage_sign_check_label: 'Find in the contract',
  mortgage_sign_early_repayment_summary: 'Check what it costs to close the loan early.',
  mortgage_sign_early_repayment_why: 'Every saving this page shows you from paying extra shrinks by that fee, and sometimes disappears completely.',
  mortgage_sign_early_repayment_ask: 'Give me the fee as a figure for year one, year three and year five, not as a formula.',
  mortgage_sign_early_repayment_check: 'The early-repayment clause. Whether the fee is a share of what you repay or of what is left, and whether part payments are allowed at all.',
  mortgage_sign_fx_risk_summary: 'If your income is in another currency, a change in the rate can make the payment dearer.',
  mortgage_sign_fx_risk_why: 'The National Bank applies stricter limits to foreign-currency loans, which is the regulator saying the risk is real.',
  mortgage_sign_fx_risk_ask: 'What does my monthly payment become if the lari weakens by 20%, and by 30%?',
  mortgage_sign_fx_risk_check: 'Whether the contract lets the bank convert the loan into another currency, and at whose exchange rate.',
  mortgage_sign_closing_costs_summary: 'Valuation, service and other charges do not always show up in the monthly payment.',
  mortgage_sign_closing_costs_why: 'They rarely appear in the headline figure, they come out of the money you receive, and they are why a borrower can arrive at signing short of cash.',
  mortgage_sign_closing_costs_ask: 'Give me one written list of everything I pay on the day, with each amount.',
  mortgage_sign_closing_costs_check: 'Whether any of them are taken out of the loan rather than paid separately. That changes how much money actually reaches you.',
  mortgage_sign_insurance_summary: 'Check which insurance is compulsory and which is simply offered.',
  mortgage_sign_insurance_why: 'It is a cost that runs for the whole term, and it lands in the real cost of the loan whether or not anyone mentioned it when quoting you.',
  mortgage_sign_insurance_ask: 'Which policy does the law require, which is your own condition, and may I buy it from another insurer?',
  mortgage_sign_insurance_check: 'Whether the premium is fixed or repriced each year, and what happens to your rate if you change insurer.',
  mortgage_sign_legal_cap_summary: 'Do not look at the rate alone. What matters is what you pay in the end.',
  mortgage_sign_legal_cap_why: 'A ceiling protects you only if you know it exists, and it caps the total cost rather than the headline rate. That is exactly the difference most borrowers never make.',
  mortgage_sign_legal_cap_ask: 'Put the total cost of this loan in writing, as a percentage of the amount I borrow.',
  mortgage_sign_legal_cap_check: 'That the contract states a total cost figure at all, and that it matches what you were quoted.',
  mortgage_sign_grace_title: 'A lighter first stretch',
  mortgage_sign_grace_summary: 'A low payment at the start does not make the loan cheaper.',
  mortgage_sign_grace_what: 'For the first few months you pay interest only. The payment is smaller and the debt itself does not go down.',
  mortgage_sign_grace_why: 'It is offered as a benefit and it costs money. Every such month is a month of interest on the full debt with no progress against it.',
  mortgage_sign_grace_ask: 'Give me the total cost of the loan with the lighter start and without it, as two numbers.',
  mortgage_sign_grace_check: 'Whether it is optional, and whether turning it down changes the rate you are offered.',
