  mp_inv_eyebrow: 'Investment Analysis',
  mp_inv_desc: 'Before money moves, the numbers should agree. HOMATCH models a property investment from your own figures: what it earns, when it breaks even, and how much room for error you have.',
  mp_inv_cta: 'Build your scenario',
  mp_inv_point_1: 'Yield from your inputs',
  mp_inv_point_1_d: 'Price, income and costs go in; the implied yield comes out — computed, not promised.',
  mp_inv_point_2: 'Break-even, not vibes',
  mp_inv_point_2_d: 'The model shows when the investment starts carrying itself, and which cost pushes that point furthest away.',
  mp_inv_point_3: 'Sensitivity you can see',
  mp_inv_point_3_d: 'Move a rate, a rent or a vacancy month and watch the verdict move with it — before it happens with your money.',
